// The buffer model: the planned slack of a healthy seat set and how much time each exception takes from it. A hold, a replacement still to be picked, a tugger fault and a load moved off a faulted tugger each reduce a vehicle's buffer. Tune the numbers here; getSequenceBoard reads them.
package com.vantiqse.imo

STATELESS PROCEDURE Board.bufferModel(): Object

var model = {plannedSlackSec: 860, watchSec: 600, holdSec: 100, replacementPendingSec: 60, tuggerFaultSec: 330, reassignSec: 150}
return model
